  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Highly Customizable, modular, Integrated HUD Extension system</p>\n<p>You can toggle any panel as desired</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This Mod <strong>REQUIRES</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1215-kmy-tarkov-api/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">KmyTarkovApi</a> <strong>1.4.0 or later</strong>, You <strong>MUST</strong> install it</p>\n<p><strong>Extract BepInEx folder to client directory</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support Me</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Make and Update Mods takes a lot of my free time</p>\n<p>You can support me on one of the below websites, this keeps me motivated doing modding work for you</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://afdian.net/a/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AfDian</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.buymeacoffee.com/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BuymeaCoffee</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://patreon.com/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Patreon</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Repost</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Please do not repost my work on other websites without my consent</p>\n<p>This mod is only released on the following sites:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sns.oddba.cn/27290.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Oddba</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/652-game-panel-hud\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Join Preview / Report</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Hey, would you like to try out the Preview version and help make this project better?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Join Discord to get Preview version and chat with developer</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/ckZgR43DNc\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">EFT Mods Project</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
